{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Quibi</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i>A shooting video game, but with a little story to tell.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3585740/extras/gf01.gif?t=1743432815\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i>We'll have a cute cube-shaped companion who will have to rescue his beloved. He'll discover a new place, and all he wants is for her to be reunited with his entire family.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">There will be music to liven up the destruction of enemies, and music that you might find entertaining.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">There will be different scenaries where you can fight enemies.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">More than 5 stages. Different enemies to fight.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Survive waves of enemies.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Discover the story.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3585740/extras/gf01_1_.gif?t=1743432815\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong><i>Fight to the end and don't give up </i></strong>Love can always triumph...</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3585740?t=1743432815","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3585740?t=1743432815","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3585740/7390f27120a858985c151f15b326590a67f5d515/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1743432815","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3585740/7390f27120a858985c151f15b326590a67f5d515/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1743432815","categories":[{"description":"Single-player"